These theme files are the Ghostty export of iTerm2-Color-Schemes, the same
set Ghostty 1.4.0 installs under share/ghostty/themes.

Source:  https://deps.files.ghostty.org/ghostty-themes-release-20261019-151001-86a776d.tgz
SHA-256: ab2513e316372c45c9f86e3e511aebdbfa6c39fa03c210096b19152fe288505b
